GET /v2/webinars/{webinarId}
Retrieve a webinar
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID

DELETE /v2/webinars/{webinarId}/panelists/{panelistId}
Remove a panelist from a webinar
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID; panelistId (path) — The panelist ID

DELETE /v2/webinars/{webinarId}/polls/{pollId}
Delete a webinar's Poll
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID; pollId (path) — The poll ID

GET /v2/webinars/{webinarId}/polls/{pollId}
Retrieve a webinar's poll
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID; pollId (path) — The poll ID

PUT /v2/webinars/{webinarId}/polls/{pollId}
Update a webinar's poll
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID; pollId (path) — The poll ID; body (body) — Webinar Poll

PATCH /v2/webinars/{webinarId}
Update a webinar
Required: webinarId (path) — The webinar ID; body (body) — Webinar
